---
title: "invest (LegionPreLiquidOpenApplicationSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_active: caller is investor
    q_check_active --> q_check_ended: sale active check
    q_check_ended --> q_verify_sig: hasEnded == false
    q_check_ended --> q_revert_ended: hasEnded == true
    q_revert_ended --> [*]: revert SaleEnded
    q_verify_sig --> q_check_min: verify investment signature
    q_verify_sig --> q_revert_sig: invalid signature
    q_revert_sig --> [*]: revert InvalidSignature
    q_check_min --> q_update: amount >= minimumInvestAmount
    q_check_min --> q_revert_min: amount < minimumInvestAmount
    q_revert_min --> [*]: revert BelowMinimumInvestment
    q_update --> q_transfer: investedCapital += amount
    q_transfer --> [*]: transfer bidToken from investor, emit Invested

    note right of q_check_min
        INV-001: open application - no predetermined allocation limits
        INV-002: minimumInvestAmount enforced per transaction
        INV-003: signature verification required from authorized Legion signer
        INV-004: deposit represents maximum allocation request
    end note
